<title>UK: Mar IPE gas oil delivery 148,200 tonnes - IPE.</title>
<headline>Mar IPE gas oil delivery 148,200 tonnes - IPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the expired IPE March gas oil futures contract will be 1,482 lots, or 148,200 tonnes, an IPE official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Deliveries against the February contract were 585,500 tonnes and 261,000 tonnes against January.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
